hello bioinformatics enthusiasts let's  talk about how you can access the omics  logic learn portal and start your  bioinformatics journey  all you need to do is go to the omics  logic learn portal here's the website  learn.omicslogic.com  on the portal you'll see the login  option just click on it and you can sign  in  and if you don't have an account you can  sign up for free and create one  simply type in your name  your email and set a password  you can also sign up with any of your  social media accounts and then sign in  using any of these which you have signed  up with  after that you have to complete your  profile by providing your phone number  the country that you're in your  occupation and what university you're in  as i already have an account i'm going  to sign in  the next step is to update your profile  this is a crucial step click on your  email id on the menu bar this will lead  you to the profile section  an updated profile is also necessary for  the mentors to monitor your progress so  make sure you have an updated profile  you can upload your picture your name  should be in the title case as the same  will reflect on your certificates  link your social media accounts and add  a brief bio about yourself your research  background and your research interests  you're all set to access the resources  on the portal  on the left side you can see the level  you're at  your points and your subscription  initially when you start you won't have  any points you can gain them by  completing steps of asynchronous courses  the first two courses are completely  free do check them out and start  learning  here you can see your activity and then  by clicking on the course you can see  the courses and the percentage you have  completed  you can also see the programs you're  enrolled in  you can access the projects once you  have reached a milestone of 10 000  points  and here you can see the certificates of  courses that you have completed  so that's it you're all 